  dialogNodes:
  - startTime: 0
    showTime: 0
    description: 'You should feel honoured to witness a reading from the author herself.


      Alright,
      let''s start!'
    audioClip: {fileID: 0}
    nextOption: 
  - startTime: 0
    showTime: 0
    description: "\"Though Uniwia is a youngling of a town, the tales and legends
      surrounding it are many. \n\n"
    audioClip: {fileID: 0}
    nextOption: 
  - startTime: 0
    showTime: 0
    description: 'Thus, I, the great historian Lisa have taken it upon myself to
      chronicle fact and fiction,

      so that order may emerge, from the sayings
      of many.

'
    audioClip: {fileID: 0}
    nextOption: 
  - startTime: 0
    showTime: 0
    description: 'Accounts state that where Uniwia lies now,

      a few generations
      ago there existed a small town called TeiAth.

'
    audioClip: {fileID: 0}
    nextOption: 
  - startTime: 0
    showTime: 0
    description: "It was home to craftsmen, artists and all sorts of people of science.\n\nIts
      downfall however, was brewing in the background.\r\"\n"
    audioClip: {fileID: 0}
    nextOption: Is that really how it ends?
  - startTime: 0
    showTime: 0
    description: 'Oh, it''s a bit of a cliffhanger, isn''t it?


      It''s to make
      the sequels sell better! So if you want more, make sure to check out "Chronicles
      of Uniwia II".


      Available right now!'
    audioClip: {fileID: 0}
    nextOption: 
